Detector: divide-before-multiply
ComissionList.calcWidthraw(string,uint256) (contracts/safe/safe_177_SAFE.sol#424-429) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _totalComission = widthrawPaySystemInfo[_paySystem].stat + (_value / 100) * widthrawPaySystemInfo[_paySystem].perc (contracts/safe/safe_177_SAFE.sol#426)
ComissionList.calcRefill(string,uint256) (contracts/safe/safe_177_SAFE.sol#432-437) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _totalComission = refillPaySystemInfo[_paySystem].stat + (_value / 100) * refillPaySystemInfo[_paySystem].perc (contracts/safe/safe_177_SAFE.sol#434)
ComissionList.calcTransfer(uint256) (contracts/safe/safe_177_SAFE.sol#440-445) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _totalComission = transferInfo.stat + (_value / 100) * transferInfo.perc (contracts/safe/safe_177_SAFE.sol#442)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

